/* 食材过期提醒：实时连续扫描层样式，配色/尺寸对标网页版 mat.css 的 .scan-* 系列（px 按 ×2 换算 rpx） */

.scan-root {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 999;
  background: #000;
}

.scan-camera {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.scan-frame {
  position: fixed;
  left: 8%;
  right: 8%;
  top: 18%;
  height: 30%;
  border: 4rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  border-radius: 28rpx;
}

.scan-tip {
  position: fixed;
  left: 32rpx;
  right: 32rpx;
  top: calc(48% + 32rpx);
  text-align: center;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}

.scan-bottom {
  position: fixed;
  left: 24rpx;
  right: 24rpx;
  bottom: 60rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}

.scan-cands {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
}

.scan-chip {
  padding: 20rpx 32rpx;
  margin: 8rpx;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
  color: #0b1c30;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  display: inline-block;
}
.scan-chip.on { background: #006495; color: #fff; }
.scan-chip.date { background: rgba(254, 243, 199, 0.95); color: #92400e; }
.scan-chip.date.on { background: #006495; color: #fff; }
.scan-chip.shelf { background: rgba(220, 252, 231, 0.95); color: #15803d; }
.scan-chip.shelf.on { background: #006495; color: #fff; }

.scan-confirm {
  padding: 24rpx 48rpx;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #006495;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  max-width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.scan-close {
  position: fixed;
  top: 84rpx;
  right: 28rpx;
  width: 76rpx;
  height: 76rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 44rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.scan-fallback {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.fb-text {
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}

.fb-btn {
  padding: 20rpx 48rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #006495;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.fb-btn--plain {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  color: #fff;
}
